WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
World 301 Live MMO — Step off Oathhaven Harbor, cross 2.5D bridges, and roam Ouros alongside fellow adventurers and following pets.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
18 Realms & Safe Trade — Trek real capital highways, flip items on the Grand Exchange, and deal via 2-Screen Anti-Scam Safe Player Trade.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
15 Skills to Level 99 — Forge every tier from Bronze to Barrows and 3rd-Age in the live 360-degree Hero Customizer Studio.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.500
22 Quests & Homestead Keep — Dig buried Master Clue Caskets and upgrade your personal Homestead Pool, Gilded Altar, and Portal Nexus.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Endgame Boss Trials — Flick your Ranged and Magic prayers against Wave 5 Tz-Kharoth (Lv. 98) in the Obsidian Kiln of Udûn for Golden Rare Drop Beams.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
OathQuest: World of Ouros — Play instantly on desktop and mobile.
